---
import { company, whatsappUrl, mapsUrl, mapsEmbed } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="contact-banner"><div class="container reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow light"><span></span> BİRLİKTE YOLA ÇIKALIM</p><h2>Yükünüz hazırsa,<br/><span>bizimle iletişime geçin.</span></h2></div><a class="button button-orange" href={`tel:${company.phoneHref}`}><Icon name="phone" size={20}/>Hemen Arayın<Icon name="diagonal" size={18}/></a></div><span class="banner-lines" aria-hidden="true"></span></section>
<section id="iletisim" class="section contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> İLETİŞİM</p><h2 id="contact-title">Bir telefon <span>kadar yakınız.</span></h2></div><p>Taşıma ihtiyaçlarınızı konuşmak ve hizmetlerimiz hakkında bilgi almak için bize ulaşın.</p></div><div class="contact-grid"><div class="contact-details reveal"><h3>{company.name}</h3><div class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon"><Icon name="phone"/></span><div><span class="contact-label">MUHASEBE & OPERASYON</span><a class="contact-phone" href={`tel:${company.phoneHref}`}>{company.phone}</a></div></div><div class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon"><Icon name="mail"/></span><div><span class="contact-label">E-POSTA</span>{company.emails.map(email => <a class="email-link" href={`mailto:${email.address}`}>{email.address}</a>)}</div></div><div class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon"><Icon name="pin"/></span><div><span class="contact-label">ADRES</span><address>{company.address}</address><a class="text-link small" href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Yol tarifi alın<Icon name="diagonal" size={16}/></a></div></div><div class="contact-row"><span class="contact-icon"><Icon name="clock"/></span><div><span class="contact-label">ÇALIŞMA SAATLERİ</span><p>{company.hours}</p></div></div><a class="whatsapp-link" href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="chat" size={21}/>WhatsApp üzerinden yazın<Icon name="diagonal" size={18}/></a></div><div class="map-card reveal"><iframe title="Budak Lojistik adresi — Dilovası, Kocaeli" src={mapsEmbed} width="800" height="650" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe><div class="map-caption"><div><strong>Dilovası / Kocaeli</strong><span>Mimar Sinan Mahallesi</span></div><a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Google Maps üzerinde adresi aç"><Icon name="diagonal" size={25}/></a></div><p class="map-note">Konumu Google Maps üzerinde açabilir ve yol tarifi alabilirsiniz.</p></div></div></div></section>
